# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEVER commit Vault unseal keys or root token.
# These are generated by `vault operator init` and give full access to Vault.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
vault/cluster-keys.json

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated by keycloak/k8s-oidc/setup.sh — contains your local absolute path
# and cluster-specific CA data.  Every user generates their own copy.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
keycloak/k8s-oidc/kubeconfig-oidc.yaml
keycloak/k8s-oidc/keycloak-local-ca.crt

# Generated TLS private keys (setup.sh creates these locally)
*.key
keycloak/k8s-oidc/*.pem

